---
import ProjectLayout from "../layouts/project-layout.astro";
import Button1 from "../components/button1.astro";
import Image from "../components/image.astro";
import snppyImg from "../assets/projects/page-images/snappy-trnsprnt.png"
import mowerBoard from "../assets/projects/page-images/mowerboard.png"
import simImg from "../assets/projects/page-images/sim.png"
---

<ProjectLayout name="snappy" colour="#6bc4ff">
    <div class="paragraph">
        <p>
            Snappy Nano was UVic’s Autonomous Underwater Vehicles Interdisciplinary Club RoboSub2026 submarine that competed in the annual competition down in California. 
            I had the pleasure to work alongside their software team to develop early firmware code, movement, and simulator tests.

        </p>
    </div>
    <Image src={snppyImg.src} colour="#6bc4ff" class="snppyImg"></Image>

    <div class="paragraph">
        <p>This project has developed my skills in several real world software techniques including version management, communication, prototyping, and 
            tackling learning curves. Through my time being a part of the team, I grew competent in C, C++, ROS2, Git, Gazebo, SDF, Linux systems, and had hands 
            on experience with STM, PID control, hydrodynamics, and machine learning. 
        </p>
    </div>
    <Image src={mowerBoard.src} colour="#6bc4ff" class="mowerImg"></Image>
    <div class="paragraph">
        <p>
            The project I worked on for the latter half of my contributions was on a simulator that could be used to visualized and test different parts of the software 
            for the sub. The methods implemented will help streamline future subs by allowing us to test software in an environment removed from mechanical and electrical 
            components. 
        </p>
    </div>
    <Image src={simImg.src} colour="#6bc4ff" class="simImg"></Image>
    <div class="btn">
        <Button1 href="https://github.com/uvic-auvic/snappy-nano">See Project</Button1>
    </div>
</ProjectLayout>

<style>
    
    .snppyImg{
        position: relative;
        width: 25%;
        justify-self: flex-end;
        margin: -5% -5% 0 0;
        transform: scaleX(-1);
    }
    .snppyImg :global(img){
        transform: scaleX(-1);
    }
    .mowerImg{
        position: relative;
        width: 25%;
        justify-self: flex-start;
        margin: 0 0 0 -5%;
    }
    .mowerImg :global(img){
        transform: scaleX(-1);
    }
    .simImg{
        position: relative;
        width: 25%;
        justify-self: flex-end;
        margin: 2% -5% 0 0;
        transform: scaleX(-1);
    }
    .simImg :global(img){
        transform: scale(-65%, 65%);
        border-radius: 10px;
        margin-bottom: -10%;
    }


    .btn{
        display: flex;
        align-self: center;
        justify-self: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 100%;
        font-size: clamp(.5em, 0.8vw, 2em);
    }
</style>